        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clapism</strong> is an incremental narrative game set in an empty church. A woman’s voice drifts through the speakers, asking you to clap — just to test the sound...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153890/extras/cf112130bce5daebfd59957687ee55c1.poster.avif?t=1788370285\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153890/extras/cf112130bce5daebfd59957687ee55c1.webm?t=1788370285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153890/extras/cf112130bce5daebfd59957687ee55c1.mp4?t=1788370285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clap as loud as you want — you won’t wake the neighbors.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A working boombox featuring tracks from independent artists such as <i>Emily Magpie</i> and </strong><strong><i>Mike Indest</i></strong><strong> to accompany your journey. No copyright music.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A rhythm of claps that becomes yours — and you’ll keep clapping long after the story ends.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatic progress saving — explore at your own pace, no need to start over.</strong></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clapism</strong> is an incremental narrative game set in an empty church. A woman’s voice drifts through the speakers, asking you to clap — just to test the sound...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153890/extras/cf112130bce5daebfd59957687ee55c1.poster.avif?t=1788370285\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153890/extras/cf112130bce5daebfd59957687ee55c1.webm?t=1788370285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4153890/extras/cf112130bce5daebfd59957687ee55c1.mp4?t=1788370285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clap as loud as you want — you won’t wake the neighbors.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A working boombox featuring tracks from independent artists such as <i>Emily Magpie</i> and </strong><strong><i>Mike Indest</i></strong><strong> to accompany your journey. No copyright music.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A rhythm of claps that becomes yours — and you’ll keep clapping long after the story ends.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatic progress saving — explore at your own pace, no need to start over.</strong></p></li></ul>",
